  "description": "Tweed Bassman Normal high jack, 12AY7 input and cathode-follower three-band preamp. The 12AX7 long-tailed pair, Presence loop, fixed-bias 5881 pair and 2 Ω output follow the Fender 5F6-A drawing, using the 6L6GC model for the 5881s.",
